          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 151444,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bahasa pemrograman seperti Python memungkinkan kamu menulis program yang bisa dijalankan komputer.</p><p>Klik cuplikan kode <code>print(\"Hello, World\")</code> untuk menambahkannya ke editor kode. Lalu, klik tombol di bawah untuk menjalankan program.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, World&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, World\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print(\"Hello, World\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 151451,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Program sering perlu mengingat informasi. Variabel memungkinkan hal itu.</p><p>Klik cuplikan kode untuk membuat variabel bernama <code>name</code>. Lalu, klik tombol di bawah.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>name = \"Virginia\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 151448,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sekarang program dapat menggunakan variabel <code>name</code>.</p><p>Tambahkan <code>name</code> ke baris yang belum lengkap, lalu jalankan program.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello,&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", name)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Virginia\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 151450,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebuah program dapat menjalankan beberapa instruksi secara berurutan.</p><p>Gunakan potongan kode untuk membentuk <code>print(\"How are you?\")</code> di editor kode. Lalu, klik tombol di bawah untuk melihat hasilnya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello,&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;How are you?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Virginia\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"How are you?\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>\"How are you?\"</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
